Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:54.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（海洋生物博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.25,1:22:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I SEE TREES OF GREEN ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.38,1:22:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ RED ROSES TOO ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.43,1:22:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I SEE THEM BLOOM FOR ME AND YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.68,1:22:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND I THINK TO MYSELF ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.69,1:26:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.94,1:26:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT'S WHAT YOU ARE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.20,1:27:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.04,1:27:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THO' NEAR OR FAR ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.29,1:27:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LIKE A SONG OF LOVE THAT CLINGS TO ME ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.55,1:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ HOW THE THOUGHT OF YOU DOES THINGS TO ME ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.51,1:27:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ NEVER BEFORE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.47,1:27:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ HAS SOMEONE BEEN MORE… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.40,1:27:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IN EVERY WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.99,1:27:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND FOREVER MORE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.58,1:27:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT'S HOW YOU'LL STAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.54,1:28:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT'S WHY，DARLING，IT'S INCREDIBLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.09,1:28:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT SOMEONE SO UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.89,1:28:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THINKS THAT I AM ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.14,1:28:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE，TOO ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.48,1:29:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IN EVERY WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.32,1:29:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND FOREVER MORE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.82,1:29:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT'S HOW YOU'LL STAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.87,1:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT'S WHY，DARLING，IT'S INCREDIBLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.58,1:29:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT SOMEONE SO UNFORGETTABLE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.84,1:29:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THINKS THAT I AM ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.09,1:29:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ UNFORGETTABLE，TOO ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.25,1:22:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我看到绿色的树 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.38,1:22:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也有红玫瑰 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.43,1:22:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我看到它们为我和你绽放 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.68,1:22:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我自己 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.69,1:26:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.94,1:26:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.20,1:27:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.04,1:27:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 近或远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.29,1:27:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就像一首爱的歌 依偎着我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.55,1:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你的思想如何对我做事情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.51,1:27:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从未在之前 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.47,1:27:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是否有人更 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.40,1:27:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 各方面 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.99,1:27:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 以及永远的更多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.58,1:27:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是你将如何保持 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.54,1:28:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是为什么 亲爱的 难以置信 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.09,1:28:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 某人如此难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.89,1:28:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 认为我是 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.14,1:28:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘的回忆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.48,1:29:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在各个方面 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.32,1:29:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 以及永远的更多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.82,1:29:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是您将如何保持 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.87,1:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这就是为什么 亲爱的 这太不可思议了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.58,1:29:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 某人如此难忘 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.84,1:29:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 认为我是 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.09,1:29:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 难忘的回忆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是多莉 我有短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Dory. I suffer from short-term remembory loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.34,0:00:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 你就是要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - That's exactly what you say!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们假装是别的小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. We'll pretend to be the other kids now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 多莉 - 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Dory! - Ahoy there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想玩捉迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to play hide-and-seek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我爱 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I love… Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们躲 你数数 然后来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hide and you count and come find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想跟你做朋友的鱼 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the nice fish who wants to be your friend, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 爸比 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Daddy. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我躲起来罗 - 现在数到十\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm hiding. - Now count to ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢沙子 湿湿软软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like sand. Sand is squishy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 我能跟他们玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, can I go play with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 宝贝 - 多莉 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory. Dory. Dory, honey. - Dory. Kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗流来了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undertow, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 亲爱的 千万不能靠近暗流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, honey, we have to stay away from the undertow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小乖 还记得那首儿歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sweetheart, what about that rhyme we learned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了暗流要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see the undertow and we say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 是糟糕 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's, "Heck no." Okay? Let's try it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到暗流我们就要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see the undertow and we say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有暗流 那里有暗流 那里有暗流\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the undertow! There's the undertow There is the undertow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你找到了暗流 我们看到了暗流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you found the undertow And we see the undertow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又忘记了吗 - 没 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I forget again? - No, no. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 宝贝 别放在心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetie. Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No biggie, kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我忘了你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I forget you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会忘记我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you ever forget me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肝 怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, kelpcake, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不会忘记你 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will never forget you, Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也永远不会忘记我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know you'll never forget us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到了吗 - 什么 听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - What's that? Hear what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹 我听到有人说有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, I just heard someone say hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear anybody say hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 史丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Stan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是听到有人说有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard someone say hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有好多鱼 谁都可能说有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of fish here. Anybody could have just said hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗 - 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里 - 那里 那里 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - There. There. Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我看哪里 - 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where am I looking? - There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. - Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我的妈呀 是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Oh my goodness, it's a child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小朋友 在这边 - 你好 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, kid. Over here. Hello? - Hello? Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是多莉 你们能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Dory. Can you please help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 多莉 你迷路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dory. Are you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爸妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where are your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找找看 这些鱼里有你的爸妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well we'll look around. Are any of these fish your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是多莉 你们能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Dory. Can you please help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你刚刚说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you just said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有吗 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did? - Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我得了短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I suffer from short-term remembory loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 真可怜 - 短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, how awful. - Short-term memory loss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你在这里等一下好吗 小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you wait here for one second. Okay, sweetie pie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史丹 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stan. Stan. Stan. - What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 这小可怜迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? The poor thing is lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么做 - 我们得想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want me to do? - We have to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她什么都不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't remember a thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天晓得她从哪里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could come from anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天真没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you are no help today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 宝贝 不然我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory? Sweetie? How about we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不见了 这可不妙 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone. Well, that's not good. Hey, Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多莉 我找不到我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dory. I lost my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是多莉 我得了短期失忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dory. I suffer from short-term memory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要游泳 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming Just keep swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要游泳 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming Swimming What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我找不到我家人 你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I lost my family. Can you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后一次在哪里见到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you see them last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来好笑 我忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, funny story, but I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 要跟我们一起游吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetie, do you want to come swim with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我今天听到最窝心的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the nicest offer I've gotten all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧 我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think. Uh, I can't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 谢了 不过我正在找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo, thanks, but I'm looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Can't remember. Can't remember. Can't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是多莉 我说错话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! I'm Dory. Was it something I said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 好吧 你们不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kidding. Okay, you're not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在找东西 好 懂了 约会愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for something and I… Okay, get it. Date night. Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能找到你要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope you find whatever it is you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是 知道要找什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both. Any idea what that was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们改天再一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Guess we'll hang out another time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时别太生疏喔 陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a stranger, Stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,白船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A white boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带走我儿子 拜托帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took my son! My son! Help me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, sorry! Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不见了 不见了 - 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone. He's gone. - There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 他不见了 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's gone. - It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不见了 - 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone. - It'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们带走他 我得找到那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, they took him away. I have to find the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说船 我有看到一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat? Hey, I've seen a boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 它往这边去 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have? - Uh-huh. It went this way! Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you! Thank you. Thank you so much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小克 小克 彩球破洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaus. Klaus, the pinata's drooping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿扳手给我 我来修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me the ratchet wrench. I can fix it. Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marlin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hey, guys, I was just… Ow! Ow! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 起床时间还没到 回去睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! It's not time to get up yet. You have to go back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有记住 海葵会螫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, the anemone stings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 抱歉 回去睡 回去睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh right. Yeah. Sorry. Back to bed, back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marlin? Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去睡 就这样 非常简单 回去睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to bed! That was it. Very simple. Bed. Back to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marlin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别睡了 展开新的一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're up. That's it. Ready to start the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在找个东西 - 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we were looking for something. - Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那就像昨天的事一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I remember it like it was yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 昨天的事我记不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I don't really remember yesterday all that well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为旅途中最可怕的 是那四只鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I would say the scariest moment of the trip was the 4 sharks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我以为只有三只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I thought there were 3 sharks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 绝对是四只\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, there were definitely four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是上次你说是三只啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But last time you told it, there were three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我们谁曾经横越整片大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, which one of us travelled across the entire ocean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼莫 不过我们也横越大海去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo did. Obviously we had to cross the ocean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.57,0:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 他先的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find him, so you know… He went first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是这样 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's true. Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来啦 你差点错过校外教学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you made it! You almost missed the field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,校外教学 我爱校外教学\N{\fnArial\fs30}A field trip? Ooh, I love field trips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你告诉她了 - 我有说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you told her. - I did tell her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… Dory. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷老师今天要照顾的鱼太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ray has too many fish to keep an eye on today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你今天最好不要一起上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. So it would be best if today you weren't exactly with the class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你记不住事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, you have problems remembering things sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点我倒是记得 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one thing I can remember. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,记性差不能怪你 但它却会害你乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And sometimes it's not your fault, but it can cause you to wander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷老师真的没闲工夫担心乱跑的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr Ray doesn't really have time to worry about fish who wander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 他人手不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, he doesn't have enough help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可怜 他实在太辛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor guy. You know, he's so overworked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂的 - 我完全了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand. - I totally understand now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要我担任他的当助教\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me to be the teacher's assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… No, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好荣幸喔 我从来没当过助教\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so honoured. I have never been a teaching assistant before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷老师 你有帮手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ray! You got help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okeydokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啦 小朋友 - 好啦 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, kids. - All right, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是今天了 - 就是今天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Today's the day! - Today's the day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们校外教学要学刺魟洄游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our field trip to the sting ray migration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺魟洄游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sting ray migration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道我们为何要洄游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, does anyone know why we migrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 你们一定知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You got to know this stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,洄游的目的是为了回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Migration is about going back to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 床上 - 答对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bed! - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙子里 - 不 洄游是为了回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The sand! - No! Migration is about going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 家 - 就是你来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Home. - Which is where you're from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能跟我说你们是哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can someone tell me where they're from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住大岩石旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live by a giant rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家离这里有三个珊瑚洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live 3 coral caves away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家盖满了海藻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house is covered in algae.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪长大的 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you grow up, Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Um, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人 他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family. Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我又忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Did I forget again? You see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suffer from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short-term memory loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你得了短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you remember your family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么记得你有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you have short-term memory loss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好问题 我能记住某些事是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question. See, I can remember some things because well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有道理 就像我有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make sense. Like, um, I have a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是从哪里来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know because I've… I must have come from somewhere. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不记得他们名字和长相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not remember their names and what they look like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我永远没办法再找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I may not even be able to ever find them again, but, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在说什么 - 妈咪和爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What were we talking about? - Mommies and daddies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪和爸比 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommies and daddies. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要谈妈咪和爸比 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we talking about mommies and daddies? Oh. Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那门课啊 干嘛找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That class. Uh-oh. Why me? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们年纪似乎蛮小的 不过没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys seem a little young, but, um, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友 两条鱼恋爱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, kids, when two fish love each other…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲到这里就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll stop right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧 小小探险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb aboard, explorers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起唱一首洄游之歌罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a migration song coming on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是洄游 一起来认识回游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Migration, migration let's learn about migration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识的探索无穷无尽充满惊奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nature's inspiration to move around the sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋科学告诉我们 海洋性洄游的鱼类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a scientific promise That a fish who's Oceanodromous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都到哪去了 我只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did everyone go? I'm by myself Oh there they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳温度影响海洋温度 增减四度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus or minus 4 degrees based on solar positioning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友 别靠近悬崖边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, kids stay away from the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 大家别靠近悬崖边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you hear that? Okay, everybody stay back from the edge. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那样太远了 - 太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, that's too far. - That's too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 回来这里 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Get back over here. Back this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要大家听我说 - 注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, I need everyone to listen to me. - All right, listen up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魟鱼经过这里时 - 魟鱼会经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When the rays pass through here… - The rays, gonna pass through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要当心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have to be careful of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家要当心什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody has to be careful of what? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗流 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The undertow! That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是暗 暗流\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. The under… The undertow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为拍动鳍所产生的水流很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the current created by all the flapping is very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们不小心 有可能被拖进\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're not careful, you can get pulled into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷老师 刺魟怎么知道该往哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ray! So how do the stingrays all know where to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就叫本能 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what an instinct is, Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是内心一种很熟悉的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something deep inside you that feels so familiar that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不得不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to listen to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一首熟悉的老歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a song you've always known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就听到那首歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can hear mine now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,随潮起潮落 回家路不用愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}To and fro, our hearts know where to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心澎湃无法自拔 只想回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beating like a drum it sends us back to where we're from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 跟着心走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… we're going home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天黑夜不停留 只想回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who we are… And it's time to travel far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥远又奔波 只为能回到家喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}For days and nights we'll roam, to make our way back home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着心走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… we're going home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,随潮起潮落 回家路不用愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swimming to and fro, Our hearts know where to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心澎湃无法自拔 只想回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beating like a drum, it sends us back to where we're from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到暗流我们就要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see the undertow and we say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她死了吗 - 当然没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she dead? - No, she's not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可惜 - 大家让让\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw. Oh man. - Give her some space, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾上的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jewel of Morro Bay, California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾上的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jewel of Morro Bay, California?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered something so I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的记得一件很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually remembered something! Something important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的事 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something important? What? What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定 但我还感觉得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I'm not sure any more, but I can still feel it. It's right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 谢谢你 雷老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thank you, Mr Ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 赶快想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on. Try to remember better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟多莉一样 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such a Dory, Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 我 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I don't know. I… Hold on. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 怎样 想起来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… Oh. Oh! - What? Did you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得 那是一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, I don't remember. It was something… It was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, oh! It was something about the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾上的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jewel of Morro Bay, California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人 我记得我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family! I remember my family!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就在外头 我得去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there somewhere. I have to find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得帮我 有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, you got to help me. Guys! Guys! Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 你们去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Ah! Where did you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你跑掉的 - 我想起我爸妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were the one to go. - My parents. I remembered them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你想起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What did you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起他们了 我妈 我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered them! My mom. My dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有家人 他们不知道我在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a family. Oh! They don't know where I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 不 这太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, no. No! This is crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly are you trying to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去芭辣湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Gem of the Baltic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加州莫洛湾上的宝石 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Jewel of Morro Bay, California. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 多莉 加州在海洋的另外一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dory. California's all the way across the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好快出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'd better get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何每次我们到这珊瑚礁边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come every time we're on the edge of this reef, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有人想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of us is trying to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不能好好欣赏风景吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, can't we just enjoy the view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起我的家人 你怎么还在讲风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be talking about the view when I remembered my family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不做海洋旅行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! We've done our ocean travels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种日子结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That part of our lives is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行唯一的理由就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason to travel in the first place is so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再也不必旅行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to travel ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I want to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 听着 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory, look… - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我好想念他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that I miss them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好想他们 以前我不懂那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, really miss them. I didn't know what that felt like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that feels like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know what that feels like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:15:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要忘记它 我的家人就在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to forget this. Somewhere out there is my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 马林 我自己找不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Marlin, I can't find them on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会忘记 求求你帮我找我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll forget. Please help me find my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 爸 你能带我们越过大海吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dad, you can get us all the way across the ocean. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道一个家伙可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呼 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Righteous, righteous, righteous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally sick. Totally sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 很酷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Isn't it great?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm gonna be totally sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是加州洋流 兄弟 劲道可强的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the California current, dude. It's got some gnarly chop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上冲 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surf's up, dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你想吐 帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dude, if you're gonna hurl, just do me a solid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到龟壳后面去 伸出头往外边吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}head to the back of the shell, lean out, and go for distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫喂鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call that "feeding the fishes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全正确 小古\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correctamundo, Squirt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要到大西洋的芭辣湾 找我爸妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're looking for my parents at the Brooch of the Atlantic? Or the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加州莫洛湾上的宝石 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Jewel of Morro Bay, California. - Exactly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么找到你爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna find your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得他们长什么样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what they look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对记忆这事还挺陌生 没什么把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bit new to the memory thing, so I can't say for sure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该大部分是蓝色 带点黄条纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something tells me they were mostly blue, with s… Maybe yellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信见到面就会认得他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also I'm pretty sure I'm gonna know them when I see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一家人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过 横越海洋这种事只能做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way crossing the ocean is the kind of thing you should…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只该一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}only do once. One time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾就快到了 伙伴们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morro Bay, California's coming up, dudes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呼 出发找我的家人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Let's find my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 爸 别推我 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go, Dad. Don't push me, Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 小蓝 祝你找到你的爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, Little Blue! Hope you find your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也祝你喂鱼愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good luck "feeding the fishes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了 我吐光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late. Already fed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好熟悉啊 妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels familiar. Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 多莉 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Dory! Dory! Wait! Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别大吼大叫 你真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop yelling for a second. Do you really think your parents…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母会漂在这里等你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are just gonna be floating around here waiting for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 但要试了才知道 妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know, but there's only one way to find out. Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大声点 多莉 - 妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yell louder, Dory. - Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘘 - 什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sh! - What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我以前听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I've heard that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得有人说嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember someone saying, "Sh."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那是我一分钟前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well done. That was me. One minute ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问有人看到我的爸比和妈咪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Have you seen my mommy and daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫珍妮和查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their names are Jenny and Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮和查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny and Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 珍妮和什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Jenny and what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的名字 我爸妈叫珍妮和查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are their names! My parents are Jenny and Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 等等 - 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory, wait! - Jenny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能先花点时间拟个计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we just take a moment to come up with a plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮 查理 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenny! Charlie! - Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 - 抱歉 她有点激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - Sorry, she's a little excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮 查理 - 多莉 先别大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenny! Charlie! - Dory, stop yelling for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,初来乍到就这么引人侧目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a good idea to come into a new neighbourhood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在不是一件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and call this much attention to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.29,0:18:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 我想起我爸妈的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I remembered my parent's names!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny! Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些螃蟹是在地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These crabs are locals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们别吵一定有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I get the feeling they're shushing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会吵醒什么危险的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}us for a reason. You might wake up something dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指那种有一只大眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you talking about like something with one big eye…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有触手 还会咬人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}tentacles, and a snappy thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样太指名道姓了 但是差不多啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's very specific, but something like that, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整体来说 就是不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just in general don't want to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my goodness. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是误会 我们会走开 放过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a mistake. We're backing away. Let us live and we will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就膜拜你 为你盖一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll worship you. We'll build a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢纪念碑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like a monument?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀 快逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Ooh! Whoa! Swim for your life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼莫 - 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! - Nemo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼莫 - 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! - Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 抓住我 不要放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, hold on to me and don't let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 慢点 没人在追我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Dory, slow down! We're not being chased any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮和查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny and Charlie. Jenny and Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起他们的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remembered their names!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续游 快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep going. We're so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼莫 - 你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Nemo, are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 尼莫 你还好吗 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my goodness! Nemo! Are you okay? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别吵 多莉 拜托 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not now, Dory. Please! - Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼莫 不 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo. Oh no. Oh no. - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Nemo. I'm sorry. Okay. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 尼莫 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my goodness! Nemo, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说别吵 你做得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Not now." You've done enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗 糟糕 我可以帮忙 我去求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have? Oh no. But I can fix it. I can. I'll go get help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做一件事 多莉 到那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you can do, Dory? You can go wait over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边等 然后忘记 那是你最拿手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go wait over there and forget. It's what you do best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 我怎么会以为我做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I don't know why I thought I could do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能找到我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find my family. I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉 我会弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I'll fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 我去求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay. - Well, I'm gonna get help. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以 你没事的 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I can do that. I'll be… It'll be all right, Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Someone? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗 有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone? Hello? Anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我是海博馆馆长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - I 'm Sigourney Weaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 馆长 我需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hi, Sigourney. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you please join us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Great, great, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索太平洋各地的美景\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we explore the wonders of the Pacific Ocean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其中的奇妙生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the amazing life it holds within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,近距离欣赏白鲸的雄伟气势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness the majesty of the Beluga Whale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,海博馆馆长 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sigourney Weaver, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! There you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到帮手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! I found help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,海博馆馆长会告诉我们这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sigourney Weaver's gonna tell us where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 - 真不尊重海洋生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, look at this! - No respect for ocean life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马林 尼莫 - 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marlin! Nemo! - Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎么又来了 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Not again! Not again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她进去 看看她的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take her inside and see how she does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 多莉 冷静 我们会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Dory! Stay calm. We'll come find you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到海洋生物博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And welcome to the Marine Life Institute…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的信念是救援 治疗复健和释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we believe in Rescue, Rehabilitation and Release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marlin? Nemo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Can you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What's happening? Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're done here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 你是科学家 我们谈过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, cut it out. You're a scientist. We talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 好玩嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. It's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我没事的 只要想办法离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy. Okay. This is… I'll be fine, I just need to find a way out and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我 镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just… Get a hold of yourself, get a hold of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 一切都会过去 想开点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine, everything's fine, think positively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你 - 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,转圈妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 嗨 我是多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank goodness. Hi, I'm Dory. I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,人称七条郎 你病得多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Hank. How sick are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,病 我病啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick? I'm sick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你怎么来隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would you be in quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 我剩多少时间 我得去找家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! How long do I have? I have to find my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 先不要慌张 喔 不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Now don't get hysterical… Uh-oh. Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么回事 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it? What happened? What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是把不能适应的鱼送走的标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a transport tag for fish who can't cut it inside the institute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,被转送到水族馆永久安置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get transferred to permanent digs. An aquarium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:22:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在克里夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的鱼可以回海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish in here, go back in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里夫兰的鱼永远留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleveland fish, stay there forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里夫兰 不 我不能去克里夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleveland? No! I can't go to the Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到加州莫洛湾上的宝石 去找我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get to the Jewel of Morro Bay, California and find my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到啦 海洋生物博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's this place. The Marine Life Institute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾上的宝石 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jewel of Morro Bay, California. You're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈在这里 我得去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean I'm from here? My parents are here. I have to get to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪个展览馆来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what exhibit are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.27,0:23:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我从展览馆来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I'm from an exhibit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个 我得过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one? I have to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就难说了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. That's a hard one, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非 行不通 太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless… Nah. Never work. It's too crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.11,0:23:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 快说 再疯狂都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Just tell me. I'm okay with crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看也是 我想到一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could see that? Well, there's one thing I can think of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮你找到家人 只要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help you get to your family. If I just take…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好办法 你带我去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Great idea. You take me to find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么没想到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I think of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 要是我戴上你的标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, no, no. If I just take your tag…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能代替你坐上转送卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take your place on the transport truck then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能回到里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can go back inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你爸妈 你把标签给我就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find your family. All you have to do is give me the tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么标签 我的鳍上有标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}What tag? There's a tag on my fin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会忘记你的鳍上有标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you forget you have a tag on your fin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我得了短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. I'm sorry. I… I suffer from short-term memory loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我们刚刚说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember what we were talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没印象 我们说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm. Not a clue. What were we talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把标签交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you were about to give me your tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.07,0:24:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我蛮喜欢它的 你要它做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I kind of like my tag. Why do you want it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我才能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can go to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才能去克里夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can go to Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里夫兰 听说那是好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleveland? Mmm. I hear good things. Cleveland. Why do you want to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为留在这里 我就会被放回海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I stay here I'm gonna get released back to the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.37,0:24:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对大海有十分不愉快的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have extremely unpleasant memories of that place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想单独住在玻璃箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to live in a glass box alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.50,0:24:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已 标签给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I want. So give me your tag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别碰我的标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, don't touch my tag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.80,0:24:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是工作人员 也没有这里的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work here. It's not like I have a map of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.15,0:24:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}A map! Good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我去找地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take me to the map, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.57,0:24:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能弄清楚我爸妈在哪 赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure out where my parents are. Oh boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.53,0:24:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我带你去找家人 你就会给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. If I get you to your family will you give me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.49,0:24:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上没多少东西 就给你这个标签吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much. Um, I… How about if I give you this tag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我真的那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you absolutely sure that's what I said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.88,0:25:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边等 然后忘记 你最拿手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Go wait over there and forget. That's what you do best."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 爸 - 我那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, Dad. - I said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.01,0:25:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么说 多莉就游向海面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that, Dory swam to the surface, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.93,0:25:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果就被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she got taken by some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再把整个过程听一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I don't want to hear the whole story again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.60,0:25:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只问一个部分 因为要是我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just asking about the one part because, look, if I said that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不确定我有没有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not positive I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.35,0:25:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那其实是在称赞她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually a compliment because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我叫她等 然后说你最拿手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her to wait and I said, "It's what you do best."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I… Oh, it's my fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.44,0:25:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我害她被绑架 带进这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault she got kidnapped and taken into whatever this place is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.32,0:25:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一它是餐厅怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's a restaurant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy! You two! Shut it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要睡觉 你们打断了我的美梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're trying to sleep! You interrupted my favourite dream!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你躺在这石头上的那个梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the one about you laying on this rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.50,0:25:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 那个梦很赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Oh, that is a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是说啊 - 它是我最喜欢的一个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh yeah, isn't it? Yeah. - It's one of my favourites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.74,0:25:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我们想… - 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse us. Hello! We're trying to… - Son! Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.17,0:25:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是海狮 天生的掠食者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are sea lions. They are natural predators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时都可能扑过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could pounce at any moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.97,0:25:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看来没那么猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they don't look very pouncy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是看你好骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they want you to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在我后面 让我跟他们谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get behind me and let me do the talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我们很担心我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, we're worried about our friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一家餐厅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls that a restaurant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 那不是餐厅 你朋友安啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mate, it's not a restaurant. Your friend is okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 那是一间鱼医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is? - It's a fish hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海博馆馆长说她会被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sigourney Weaver says she'll be rescued, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗复健 再释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}rehabilitated, and released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.62,0:26:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去马上就出来了 我们有经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be in and out in a jiff. We should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.78,0:26:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鼻子长寄生虫 - 贫血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nasal parasite. - Anaemia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好就放我们出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All fixed up and sent on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.37,0:26:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 一点都不用担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, that's all right. Don't you worry ab…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿杰 快下去 - 滚 阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gerald, get off the rock! - Shove off, Gerald! Come on. Off! Off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.84,0:26:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讲不听 滚 - 滚 滚 滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off! Now you know better! Off! - Off! Off! Off! Off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不用担心 那是海洋生物博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about a thing. That place is the Marine Life Institute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.93,0:26:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州莫洛湾上的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jewel of Morro Bay, California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说错 看来多莉不是只会忘东忘西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right. It looks like Dory can do something besides forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 尼莫 谢谢你喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Nemo. Thank you for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.36,0:26:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are we gonna get inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.02,0:26:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们要进海博馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You want to get inside MLI?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.15,0:26:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要 我们朋友单独在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperately. Our friend is in there. Lost, alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很害怕 一定不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's scared. She'll have no idea what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.45,0:27:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we know a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.62,0:27:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do? Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo-roo. Ooo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在干嘛 - 不知道 听来不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they doing? - I don't know. It sounds bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了吗 嘘 小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there yet? Sh. Keep it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 真高兴遇见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, I'm so glad I found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像命运的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like… I… Destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讲几百万遍了 这不是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what must be the millionth time, it's not destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有讲命运吗 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh. Have I said "destiny" before? I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快见到爸妈了 才这么紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just so nervous because I'm gonna meet my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道多久没见过他们了 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen them in I don't even know how long because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得了短期 - 短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you see I suffer from short-term… - Short-term memory loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别讲话 好吗 我不爱讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no more talking. Okay? I don't like talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.73,0:27:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢聊天和问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like chatter and questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.77,0:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, "How are you? Oh I'm fine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 我也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How are you? I'm fine too."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 其实谁都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}News flash, nobody's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.57,0:27:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm fine. How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七条郎 有地图吔 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hank, look, there's a map! - Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.95,0:27:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了让你看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is you're gonna read that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.20,0:27:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄清楚你爸妈住哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and figure out where your parents live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.66,0:27:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我坐卡车到克里夫兰 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm on the truck to Cleveland. You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了 你前半段说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. What was the first part again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.75,0:27:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 章鱼又逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The octopus escaped again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.75,0:27:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你看这么多展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Look at all the exhibits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天怎么逛得完 太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you do this park in one day? Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快挑一个 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pick one! - Okay. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.80,0:27:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫所有人留意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell everyone to keep an eye out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.63,0:28:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天应该要把那只章鱼放回大海的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be releasing the octopus back to the ocean today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.81,0:28:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然没看到 要是看到就找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course I haven't seen him. If I was looking I'd find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.81,0:28:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank! There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! - Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.56,0:28:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个字是儿 儿 区 儿童体验区\N{\fnArial\fs30}K. It starts with a "k". Kid z-own-y. Kid zone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 儿童会乱抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No kids. Kids grab things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.90,0:28:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想为你再失去一只触手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not losing another tentacle for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.03,0:28:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少了一只触手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost a tentacle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不是八爪章鱼 是七爪章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then you're not an octopus, you're a septopus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记性虽然不好 但还会数数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not remember, but I can count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.58,0:28:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,深海探 看 贝壳吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Journey to the… Hey, look. Shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝壳吔 爸比 这个贝壳送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. Shells! addy, here's a shell for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒 多莉 你又找到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great, Dory. You found another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有吗 - 有 你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did? - Oh, yes, you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越厉害了呢 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting good at this, Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 贝壳吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. Shells!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.02,0:28:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我住那里 - 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I live there. - Yes! Yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢贝壳 - 没错 小乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like shells. - That's right, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.24,0:29:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再帮我找一个贝壳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could find me another shell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.11,0:29:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫色是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purple ones are my favourite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.83,0:29:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.91,0:29:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 紫色贝壳 我家有一个紫色贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy. Purple shell. Purple shell! Hey, my home had a purple shell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.42,0:29:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里半数的展览馆都有紫色贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the exhibits here have purple shells in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不懂 我想起她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You don't understand. I remember her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫色贝壳是她的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purple shells were her favourite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她咯咯笑的样子很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she had this adorable giggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸真的很和蔼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then my dad was really friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.51,0:29:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的怪记性会害我们被抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now your wacky memory's gonna get us caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.47,0:29:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还觉得这是命运吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still think this is destiny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七条郎 我们得去找我父母 - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hank, we have to find my folks! - Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 我是卡萝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Base, this is Carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.49,0:29:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能找到那只失踪的章鱼 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think I might have found that missing octopus. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.66,0:29:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是你害的 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See what you did? - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没比这更倒楣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could not be worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm."Destiny." Destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七条郎 我有预感 - 我们该躲进那水桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hank. I got a feeling. - Sh! I think we should get in the bucket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 停 - 真的 上面写命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Stop. - Seriously. It says "destiny" and it is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.25,0:30:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们到那水桶里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no, no. - We've got to get in that bucket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.01,0:30:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不跟你进那个水桶 - 我要进水桶里了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going with you in that bucket. - Here… I… go… in… the… bucket. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 我在找我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, I'm looking for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.85,0:30:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好办法 装死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good idea. Play dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我得眨眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I got to blink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.98,0:30:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么都不用眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you hold your eyes open that long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.83,0:30:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 不太妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.92,0:30:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位贵宾在这里待很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our next guest has been here a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是只鲸鲨 名叫命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a whale shark. Her name is Destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.97,0:30:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny? Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.39,0:30:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会发现她近视很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll notice she's extremely near-sighted and has trouble…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法在环境中游动自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}navigating her environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.27,0:30:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And here she comes now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 你是一条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Destiny. You're a fish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.44,0:31:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 你好啊 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! Hello there. - Whoa! Oh. Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.53,0:31:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我陪你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.79,0:31:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.12,0:31:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 是蓝泡泡在讲话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blue blob talking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.54,0:31:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗 我跟家人失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me? I lost my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟家人失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.29,0:31:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长 其实我不太记得发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a long story, and truth be told, I don't remember most of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.17,0:31:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真教人难过 你好可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, that is so sad. You poor thi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.43,0:31:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 泳技不佳 我看不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Not a great swimmer. I can't see very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的泳姿很漂亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think you swim beautifully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.43,0:31:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看过一条鱼那样游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I've never seen a fish swim like that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.27,0:31:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Say that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.23,0:31:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.99,0:31:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.91,0:31:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们以前就认识了 - 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and I were friends! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.12,0:31:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 是我 命运 - 你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory, it's me! Destiny! - You know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.49,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们小时候透过水管聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course! We talked through the pipes when we were little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.33,0:31:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是管友 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were pipe pals! - We were?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好漂亮 - 那你知道我从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw, you're so pretty. - So you know where I'm from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你从大洋区展览馆来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, you are from the Open Ocean exhibit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.92,0:32:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自大洋区展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from the Open Ocean exhibit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.51,0:32:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我爸妈就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that's where my parents are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.01,0:32:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走 你能带我去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go. Can you take me there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.59,0:32:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲸鱼在这里还蛮难趴趴走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Kind of tough for a whale to travel around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.43,0:32:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们小声一点好吗 我头好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please keep it down over there? My head hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.02,0:32:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被送进来时头受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was brought in with a head injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.52,0:32:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在说我 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're talking about me, Destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.77,0:32:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为他不能用他的传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he can't use his echolocation, but I've overheard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.06,0:32:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我听那些医生说 他根本没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}the doctors talking. There's not a thing wrong with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.27,0:32:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话我听得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear every word you're saying about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's echolocation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸的头可以发出声波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bailey's head is supposed to put out a call and the echo helps him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.61,0:32:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,回声能帮他找到远处的物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}find objects far away. Oh, b{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.16,0:32:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他显然还在治疗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}ut apparently he's still "healing."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.91,0:32:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在说我 我真的不能传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know you're talking about me. I really can't echolocate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.71,0:32:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再跟你辩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot have this conversation again. I just can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头狠狠撞了一下 看它肿得多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit my head very hard out there. See how swollen it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头本来就大 你是白鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head is supposed to be big! You're a beluga!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.26,0:32:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,传声定位 像是史上最强眼镜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echolocation. Oh, like the world's most powerful pair of glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.72,0:32:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么是眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What are glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.89,0:32:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你呜一声 就看得到东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sort of like you go, "hoo" and then you see things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.22,0:32:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.56,0:33:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.90,0:33:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 听好 我们算扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are! Listen up, you and I are square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.77,0:33:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你找到地图 标签给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took you to the map, now give me that tag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.44,0:33:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我知道我父母在哪 他们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no. I know where my parents are. They're in the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里叫什么 太痒区\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it called? The place… The soap and lotion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大洋区 - 大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open Ocean. - Open Ocean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大洋区 我知道它在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open Ocean! I know where that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个展览馆旁边就是 我才不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the exhibit located right next to… I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到大洋区展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're trying to get to the open ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.83,0:33:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要穿过这水管就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}exhibit go through the pipes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.42,0:33:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 穿过水管 太好了 - 穿过水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Through the pipes. Great. - Through the pipes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 左转两次 直直游就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Take two lefts, swim straight and you'll hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.97,0:33:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,转好多方向啊 你记住了吗 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a lot of directions. That's… Did you get that, Hank? All that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 太好了 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yeah. - Great! Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.60,0:33:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不跟你去 我挤不进去 你得自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going with you. I won't fit. You have to go by yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 因为我没办法记住方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's… I'm… I… See, I can't because I'm not so good with directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 但我们说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's too bad. A deal's a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要找你的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to find your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.86,0:33:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,游进去才能找到 把标签给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you get to them. Now give me your tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.99,0:33:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 我不能自己进水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Hank, I can't go in the pipes alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.70,0:33:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会忘记怎么走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll forget where I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.78,0:33:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,干我屁事 标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my problem. Tag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.29,0:34:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能走这条路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't get in that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.79,0:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 没有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but there's no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.21,0:34:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.96,0:34:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有别的办法了 - 好 不要慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no other way. - Now, now. Don't panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.46,0:34:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 人生不是每件事都很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Not everything in life is easy to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.13,0:34:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.67,0:34:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈说得对 太困难的事就该放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. When something's too hard, you should just give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查理 - 开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charlie! - A joke. I'm kidding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.06,0:34:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是讲笑话 小心 谐星发威了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a joke. A joke. Caution, joker at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.85,0:34:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑话 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joke. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.31,0:34:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肝 一定有别的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, kelpcake? There's always another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.53,0:34:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我爸说一定有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. My father said there's always another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.41,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? There is no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大洋区 大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open Ocean. Open Ocean. Hmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大洋区 我很确定是那边那栋建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open Ocean. I'm pretty sure it's the building over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.50,0:34:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,外型普通 圆圆的 像利鲸的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ill-defined and roundish. Like Bailey's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 什么 一定有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what? - Always another way. There's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.04,0:34:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 你们跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! Guys, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.42,0:34:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么去太痒区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how we can get to locomotion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.17,0:34:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大洋区 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open Ocean. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们知道我游不过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, guys. You know I can't swim over there, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooo-roo, ooo-roo, ooo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.56,0:35:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们怎么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see how this is going to get us inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.02,0:35:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you even doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.44,0:35:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是叫她过来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're calling her over, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.36,0:35:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫她过来 叫谁过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling her over? Calling who over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 这是贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lads, meet Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用飞的 不 别搞新花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying? No, no, no new information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.95,0:35:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 跟她说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, tell her thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经帮了很多忙 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have gone above and beyond. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是难道没有别的办法 像游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is there a way to get in that involves, like, swimming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.25,0:35:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是我们的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's really our strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.05,0:35:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们朋友会被关在隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, your friend is going to be in quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生病的鱼都关在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they take the sick fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.43,0:35:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入那地方唯一的办法就是靠贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the one and only one way into that place is Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.14,0:35:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 我们叫她尖嘴琪 超痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Stop. Let's call her Pecky because this is hurting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.77,0:35:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢你喔 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she likes you, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.27,0:35:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贝琪 这两只鱼想进隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, love? These two nice fish need to get into quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.40,0:35:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天有空吗 亲爱的贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you free today, Rebecca darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.57,0:36:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 你有空做这件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, is… Would that work with your schedule? Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本不懂我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't understand what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.95,0:36:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她把你铭印在心就好了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is imprint with her, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.75,0:36:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铭 什么 - 铭印在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Imp… What? - Imprint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.66,0:36:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着她眼睛说呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look her in the eye and say, "ooo-roo"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.08,0:36:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就会跟你同步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll be in sync with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在看着她眼睛 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now look her in the eye. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 我们应该想个替代方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, I think we should devise an alternate plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.97,0:36:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们能待在水里 找个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that involves staying in the water and someone sane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这只鸟 不能靠这只鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this bird, this bird… This ain't the bird!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.10,0:36:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.31,0:36:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正到时候多莉早忘记我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the meantime, Dory will just forget us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.27,0:36:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 这是她最拿手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said, it's what she does best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.44,0:36:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 看她的眼睛 哪只眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look her in the eye. Which eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pick one, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.62,0:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噜 贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Ooo-roo. Roo-roo, Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.00,0:36:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 非常顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is all great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.97,0:37:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪到底要怎么带我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exactly is Becky supposed to carry us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.72,0:37:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我差点忘了 阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah. I almost forgot. Gerald!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.97,0:37:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 对 阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm? - Yeah, Gerald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 孩子 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, son. - Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.81,0:37:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杰 桶子给我们 就让你坐在岩石上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Gerald. Give us your pail, we'll let you sit on the rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.31,0:37:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 阿杰 我们挂保证 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, Gerald. We swear it. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.65,0:37:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 慢慢晃过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Shimmy on over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.74,0:37:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 你没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.74,0:37:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要刮到屁股喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind you don't scuff your bum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.00,0:37:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真谢谢你 阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much, Gerald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受这块岩石吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your time on this rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.09,0:37:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comfortable, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.84,0:37:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间到 滚 滚 滚 - 时间到 滚 阿杰 滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time's up! Get off! Off! Off! Off! Off! - Time's up! Now get off, Gerald! Off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.88,0:37:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太夸张了 我怎么老是这么好骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is nuts! Why do I keep getting talked into insane choices?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.69,0:37:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我一下令 你就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, when I tell you you're gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我会溅起水花来示意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know. I'm gonna signal with a big splash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.44,0:38:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my mark. Not clear yet. Not clear yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.20,0:38:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 等命运做出暗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Not 'til Destiny gives the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.28,0:38:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我实在不懂你干嘛这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something? I have no idea why you're even doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.54,0:38:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,费这么多工夫 就为了找几条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? It seems like a lot of trouble just to find some more fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.54,0:38:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我有短暂的失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had short-term memory loss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.54,0:38:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会直接游进大海 忘掉所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just swim off into the blue and forget everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.54,0:38:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那么做 我要我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I don't want to do that. I want my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要 孩子 我不想让任何人操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me, kid. I don't want anyone to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运气好 没有记忆 没有烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky. No memories. No problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.05,0:38:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有记忆 没有烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. No memories. No problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.06,0:38:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行 还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not clear. Still not clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候还没到就别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to say when it's not time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还 - 时候到了再告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not… - Just tell me when it is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以 再等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go. And… Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 再等等 你在耍我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Here we go. Wait." Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.27,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 数到三 - 别数了 直接说 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, on the count of three. - Don't count. Just say, "Go."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.07,0:38:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 快去 快 - 什么 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Now, now. Do it! Do it! - What? Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.40,0:38:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 好壮观喔 - 那就是暗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. Look at that! I mean… - That's the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.61,0:38:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发 暗号来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! That's the signal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.75,0:38:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 命运说跟着指标到大洋区展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, Destiny said follow the signs to the Open Ocean exhibit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.46,0:39:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见 所以你得负责找它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see squat, so it's your job to look for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.80,0:39:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 跟着指标到大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Follow the signs to Open Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.09,0:39:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会复诵 这样应该就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna repeat it, okay? That should work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.84,0:39:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着指标到大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the signs to Open Ocean. Follow the signs to Open Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.39,0:39:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转 跟着指标到大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Go right! Follow the signs to Open Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.72,0:39:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着指标到大洋区 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the signs to Open Ocean. Follow the signs to Open Ocean. Left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟着指标到大洋区 - 离人类远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow the signs to Open Ocean. - And steer clear of people, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.39,0:39:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是小孩 我不要他们碰到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially kids. I don't want to be touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.94,0:39:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 不要害我分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh! Do not mess me up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可怜 我来帮你捡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, poor baby. Let me get that for you. Here you… Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.53,0:39:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my. Ugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.16,0:39:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,往哪边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go? Where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.95,0:39:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 好吧 我在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry! Okay, I was looking, looking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.04,0:39:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噜 贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roo-roo, Becky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.37,0:39:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪降落都行 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop us anywhere. We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.75,0:39:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 爸 我想她在找降落的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait, Dad. I think she's looking for a place to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.21,0:39:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她头昏了 尼莫 连该看哪里都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's confused, Nemo. She doesn't even know which way to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.30,0:39:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 贝琪 你做什么 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Becky. What are you doing? Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo-roo-roo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.93,0:40:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要去某个地方 问题是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I was going somewhere. The question is where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.31,0:40:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,往哪边 看到指标了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way? Do you see the sign?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.15,0:40:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在看 好像做什么 就能找到 我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking. I'm looking. Something to something gets me to my family!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.94,0:40:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最强\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The world's most powerful pair of…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.32,0:40:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得 我怎么认得 又是另一段记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. Why do I know that? It's another memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 我们得往那边 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, we need to go that way! Left. Go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.33,0:40:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky! Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她听不见 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't hear you, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.17,0:40:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. New plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.05,0:40:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得靠近贝琪 她才听得见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get closer to Becky so she can hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.17,0:40:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们不该移动桶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we should move the pail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.55,0:40:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 没有我 贝琪就迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo. Without me Becky's lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 相信她啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, just trust her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.31,0:40:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信她 好让她完全忘了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust her? So she can forget us all together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.48,0:40:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.44,0:40:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信她 她在吃杯子吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust her? Becky's eating a cup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.02,0:40:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 贝琪 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky! Becky! Ooo-roo! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.54,0:40:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们没困在水桶里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we're not stuck in the bucket any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也错过到隔离检疫站的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or on top of quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,海獭宝宝脱口秀现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby otter talk is beginning now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.84,0:41:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 海博馆馆长 谁想认识海獭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, thanks, Sigourney Weaver. Hey, who wants to learn about otters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.43,0:41:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到史上最强眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the world's most powerful pair of glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.10,0:41:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,海獭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.39,0:41:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 这是一场拥抱派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, it's a huge cuddle party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.02,0:41:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱派对 我要参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuddle party! I'm in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.60,0:41:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪 靠近大洋区了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we? Are we close to Open Ocean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.31,0:41:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧 不晓得 但我看到另一个指标 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes. I think… Well, I don't know. But I saw that other sign so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.81,0:41:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么其它指标\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What other sign?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.07,0:41:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,指标是史上最强眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's most powerful pair of glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.74,0:41:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在胡说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.36,0:41:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要跟那个指标走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would we follow that sign?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.07,0:41:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我记得啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because I remembered it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.78,0:41:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你完全弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That wasn't the plan. Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.70,0:41:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 你浪费了我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it! You have wasted my time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.75,0:41:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 不 - 转运卡车天亮就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. No. - That transport truck leaves at dawn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能错过它 把标签给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not missing it, so give me your tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.00,0:41:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不 我记得那个指标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No, I remembered that sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以咧 - 所以我记得的越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So I'm remembering more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.30,0:41:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记性好像越来越好了 我想我们该\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more and I feel like my memory's getting better. I think we should…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.80,0:41:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你的记性根本不行 什么都记不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Your memory is not working. You can't remember anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.64,0:41:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概就是这样才弄丢家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably how you lost your family in the first place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.18,0:42:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们先冷静一下 把标签给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, let's just take it down a notch. Just give me the tag and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.06,0:42:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虽然有三颗心 心地却不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a guy with three hearts you're not very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.36,0:42:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三颗心 你在说什么 我没有三颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hearts? What are you talking about? I don't have three hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.86,0:42:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.11,0:42:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,趣味小常识 章鱼有三颗心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun fact-the octopus has three hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.41,0:42:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,二心传导血液至鳃 一心传导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pump blood to the gills while the third pumps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.66,0:42:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 血液至全身 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- blood throughout the body. - Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.00,0:42:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三颗心的人不该这么坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, someone with three hearts shouldn't be so mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.13,0:42:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我弄丢我爱的人真的很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's mean to say that I would lose someone I love!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.92,0:42:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没弄丢他们 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not lose them! Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.59,0:42:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank? Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.76,0:42:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摸 - 不摸 我要找七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Han-s. - No. Not Hans. I'm looking for Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 触摸 - 七条郎 是章鱼 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Han-s. - Hank. With a "k". Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.06,0:42:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 触摸 - 触摸 喔 触摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands! - Hands? Oh, oh, oh, hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank! Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.82,0:42:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.20,0:42:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.91,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗 我在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Ahh! Can you please help me? I'm looking for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托帮我 我跟朋友法兰克失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me. I've lost my friend Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.79,0:43:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是法兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, not Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.83,0:43:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闯进我地盘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my space!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.63,0:43:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是八爪章鱼 不 七爪章鱼 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an octopus. No, septo… Septopus. That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.05,0:43:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是七爪章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a septopus. Septopus. Septopus. Septopus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.26,0:43:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二三四五六 七爪章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four, five, six, s… Septopus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.30,0:43:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他伪装起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's camouflaged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 快 七条郎 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank. Come on, Hank! Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.85,0:43:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank! What's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.44,0:43:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算是永远待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is I'm gonna stay here forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.73,0:43:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Good plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.03,0:43:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 七条郎 我都记不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Hank. I'm sorry. I can't remember right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.16,0:43:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 宝贝 - 当心 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetie. Sweetie. - Oh, watch out, kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.41,0:43:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,游泳时注意一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, watch where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.62,0:43:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸比 我都记不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Daddy. I'm sorry I can't remember right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.87,0:43:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你不用说对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetie. Sweetie, you don't need to be sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你该做什么吗 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you need to do? Just keep swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.51,0:44:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定能够记住 因为我们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And I bet you can remember that because we're just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.18,0:44:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来唱一首关于它的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sing a song about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.76,0:44:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要游泳 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming Just keep swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.77,0:44:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要游泳 游泳游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming Swimming, swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.48,0:44:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办 就游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? We swim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.52,0:44:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,游啊游啊游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim, swim, swim We swim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.57,0:44:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 游啊游 游泳 - 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We swim, swim, swim - Just keep swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首歌是爸妈教我的 我们全家一起唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents taught me that song! We sang it as a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为是我乱编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time I thought I made it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.20,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么歌 - 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What song? - Just keep swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.91,0:44:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 我们只要游泳就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, we've just got to keep swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No way! Listen to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.75,0:44:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,游出去太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too dangerous to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.38,0:44:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.38,0:44:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你害怕 但你不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're scared, but you can't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.34,0:44:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要游泳 只要游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming Just keep swimming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.22,0:44:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈叫我尽管游\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom wrote this song for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.47,0:44:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有条路行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get us out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.81,0:44:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我唱 七条郎 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing with me, Hank. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.14,0:44:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 妈咪 我来了 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Mommy. I'm coming, Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.44,0:44:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会有事的 - 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna be okay. - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.81,0:44:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Turn back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.48,0:44:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.02,0:44:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面就是戳戳湾了 戳戳湾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're headed right for Poker's Cove. Poker's Cove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.32,0:45:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戳戳湾 - 手指来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Poker's Cove? - Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.20,0:45:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.45,0:45:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.13,0:45:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 大家都这样 没什么好丢脸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. That's okay. Everybody does it. Nothing to be ashamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.63,0:45:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 七条郎 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank? Oh, Hank. There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.26,0:45:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You got us out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.43,0:45:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.94,0:45:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让我们逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got us out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.31,0:45:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实在的 也是你害我们进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, technically you also got us in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.73,0:45:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要不是那样 我们也不见得能到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you hadn't I'm not sure we would have gotten here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.45,0:45:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,传声定位 传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echolocation. Echolocation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.58,0:45:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最强眼镜 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's most powerful pair of glasses. We found it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.83,0:45:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你找到了那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You found that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.79,0:45:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到大洋区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Open Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.34,0:46:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.72,0:46:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo, ooo-roo. Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.72,0:46:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo, ooo-roo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.02,0:46:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 放弃吧 她不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, stop. She's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might. Ooo-roo, ooo-roo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.15,0:46:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你害她觉得自己做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! You made her feel like she couldn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.45,0:46:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的不是贝琪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not talking about Becky, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.91,0:46:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.95,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.58,0:46:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我真的非常担心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, I'm just so worried about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才应该替我们担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one who should be worried about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.42,0:46:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她在这里 一定知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she would definitely have an idea of what to do if she were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how she does that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像没想那么多 就是放手去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she knows, Dad. She just does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.93,0:46:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们好好想一想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we'll just have to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.98,0:46:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉会怎么做 - 多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would Dory do? - What would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! What would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.07,0:47:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会评估自己的状况 然后仔细推敲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would assess her situation, and then she'd evaluate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.03,0:47:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再分析有哪些作法\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she would analyse her options…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.74,0:47:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 那是马林会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, that's "what would Marlin do."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.32,0:47:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我会那么做 她根本不会多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, that's what I would do. She wouldn't even think twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.16,0:47:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一看到眼前的东西就\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would just look at the first thing she sees and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.97,0:47:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉会放手去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory would do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.89,0:47:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 抓紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, hold on to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.48,0:47:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's working! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.86,0:47:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续喘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep gasping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.66,0:47:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.62,0:47:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 现在多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! What would Dory do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.41,0:47:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.58,0:48:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀 真高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy. Are we happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴见到我 我才高兴咧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to see me? I'm happy to see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.46,0:48:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好几年没有人可以说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had anyone to talk to in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.26,0:48:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几年 可惜我们不能逗留太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years? Wow. Unfortunately we can't stay long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.26,0:48:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.30,0:48:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必急着走 你们才刚到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why would you want to go? You just landed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.10,0:48:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,留一会儿嘛 聊聊你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay a while. Tell me all about yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.93,0:48:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.77,0:48:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我儿子跟我得去隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my son and I have to get to quarantine, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有儿子真好 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wonderful thing to have a son. - Yeah it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.31,0:48:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 我没有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I don't have a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.40,0:48:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟一个扇贝交往过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dated a nice scallop for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很好啊 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fascinating, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.28,0:48:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是扇贝有雪亮的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But scallops have eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.57,0:48:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想找个不一样的对象 我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was looking for something different. I'm kidding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.78,0:48:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟扇贝有眼睛没关系 但他们真的有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not about scallops having eyes. They do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.91,0:48:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能看透你的心 让你心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they see into your soul and they break your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.33,0:48:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝贝 为什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Shelley! Why? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.83,0:48:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一起探索大洋区的神秘世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us as we explore the mysterious world of the Open Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.63,0:48:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七条郎 跟我来 - 你在杯子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Hank, follow me. - You're in a cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那我跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'll follow you then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.23,0:49:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 章鱼有三颗心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - An octopus has three hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.86,0:49:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有趣的小常识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. That's a fun fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 真的要成功了 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here. This is really happening. Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就是这里了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like this is it, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.68,0:49:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我得去赶卡车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I got a truck to catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.22,0:49:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我有东西要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait! I had something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.19,0:49:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 标签 - 标签 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tag. - The tag. Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我想我会记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think I'm gonna remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.29,0:50:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一秒过后你就会忘记我的 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll forget me in a heartbeat, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能三秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three heartbeats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.58,0:50:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是不会轻易忘记你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a hard time forgetting you though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.63,0:50:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈真的就在下面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents are actually down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.06,0:50:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.68,0:50:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.31,0:50:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.15,0:50:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.24,0:50:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they? Where are they? Where are they? Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.08,0:50:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 有看到一对 没带着小孩的父母吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Hello. Have you seen a mom and a dad without me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.30,0:50:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 有看到一对夫妻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Have you seen a couple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.09,0:50:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟你一样老\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're old like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.55,0:50:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是跟你一样老 可能比你还老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not old like you, but older than you even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.05,0:50:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.39,0:51:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁很久以前有小孩走失吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Do you know anyone who lost a kid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.06,0:51:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子是我喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long time ago that would be me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.68,0:51:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道过了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how long ago exact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.14,0:51:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你在赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You're in a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.98,0:51:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 游泳注意一点 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ho, ho! Watch where you're going. - Oh sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.16,0:51:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our goal that every animal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.16,0:51:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救与照顾过的所有动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}we rescue and care for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.95,0:51:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后都回到他们原来的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}will eventually return home to where they belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.38,0:51:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.71,0:51:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样行了 万一你走失了 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there we go. Now, if you ever get lost, Dory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.84,0:51:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着贝壳游就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just follow the shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.80,0:51:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! Shells!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.06,0:51:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着贝壳游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.74,0:52:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我住那里 - 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I live there. - Yes, yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.08,0:52:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家 那是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My home. That's my home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.75,0:52:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肝 你数到十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kelpcake. Now count to ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.13,0:52:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.09,0:52:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.30,0:52:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟谁讲话 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you talking to, kelpcake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.18,0:52:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的管友 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pipe pal, Destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.31,0:52:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.95,0:52:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪爱紫色的贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy loves purple shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.75,0:52:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪 - 她会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy? - What's going to happen to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.46,0:52:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, Jenny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.71,0:52:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭 妈咪 别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, don't cry, Mommy. Don't cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.47,0:53:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她能独立自主吗 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she's… That she can make it on her own, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.64,0:53:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆 没事的啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey. It'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.14,0:53:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪爱紫色的贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy loves purple shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.70,0:53:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.07,0:53:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.12,0:53:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 妈咪 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Mommy! Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.96,0:53:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.71,0:53:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.34,0:53:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.18,0:53:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的标签呢 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your tag? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.02,0:53:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的标签不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tag. It's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才不在隔离检疫站吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That why you're not in quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.81,0:53:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 隔离检疫站 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quarantine? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.10,0:53:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有蓝刀鲷都在那里 是不是 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they took all the blue tangs. Isn't that right, Bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.40,0:53:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝刀鲷在克里夫兰 快要有自己的展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. The blue tangs are getting their own exhibit in Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.53,0:54:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮他们就会被卡车载走 一定很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being shipped out on a truck at the crack of dawn. Must be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.15,0:54:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我爸妈又回到隔离检疫站了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No! No, my parents are back in quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.32,0:54:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要被送到克里夫兰 可是我才刚到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're being shipped to Cleveland? But I just got here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.29,0:54:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找他们 他们不知道我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to get to them. They don't know I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.12,0:54:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 到隔离检疫站很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, it's easy to get to quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.75,0:54:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水管游过去就好了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can just go through the pipes, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.71,0:54:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.76,0:54:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我会忘记我该往哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - I'll forget where I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.68,0:54:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能待在一个 没人能帮我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't be somewhere where I have nobody to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.01,0:54:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你就困在这里了 - 别乱讲 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then I guess you're stuck here. - You're not helping, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.10,0:54:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想进去就快进去吧 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go in there if you want to. You'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.31,0:54:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.32,0:54:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能告诉我怎么走吗 从水管喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell me how to get there? Through the pipes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 亲爱的 两左一右 很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, honey. It's two lefts and then a right. Simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.08,0:54:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两左一右 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lefts and a right. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.71,0:54:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,两左一右 好 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lefts and a right. Okay. Don't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.55,0:55:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两左一右 两左一右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lefts and a right. Two lefts and a right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.68,0:55:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两左一右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lefts and a right. Two lefts and a right. Two lefts and a right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.52,0:55:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,两左一右 糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lefts and a right? Shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.61,0:55:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,左右 等等 我左转一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left and a right. Wait. Did I already take a left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 又来了 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. It's happening. Okay, hold on. Hold on, hold on, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.11,0:55:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边 我要去哪里 我想不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way? Where am I going? I can't remember. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.33,0:55:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷路了 太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm lost. It's too hard. I can't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.37,0:55:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不起来 全都忘光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm forgetting everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.33,0:55:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远困在水管里 水管 管友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be stuck forever in the pipes. The pipes! The pipe pals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.29,0:55:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,管友 管友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pipe pals? Pipe pals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.05,0:55:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 游游游 - 我觉得不太好吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And… swim, swim, swim. - Yeah, I don't know about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.72,0:55:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我不会让你撞到的 墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I won't let you hit anything. Wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.26,0:55:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必呢 我永远学不会转弯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point? I'll never learn to get around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.51,0:55:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学 在这里学不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better! If you can't do it in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.85,0:55:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,到大海更别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll never do it out in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.10,0:55:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要很专心 好吗 墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now really focus, okay? Wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.23,0:55:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.19,0:56:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在水管里迷路 而我爸妈在隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lost in the pipes and my parents are in quarantine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.36,0:56:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.99,0:56:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸 你得用你的传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bailey! You've got to use your echolocation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.15,0:56:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它已经坏啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's broken! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱讲 快发出多莉讲的那个呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop it, and try the "ooh" thing dory talked about, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.95,0:56:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的没办法 - 别让我失望 利鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I don't think I can… - Don't bail on me, Bailey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.24,0:56:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.46,0:56:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.83,0:56:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 利鲸 刚刚你怎么说的 要专心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bailey. What did you just tell me, huh? Really focus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.04,0:56:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 我好蠢喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! I feel stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.59,0:56:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利鲸 - 抱歉 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bailey. - Sorry. Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.88,0:56:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗 - 这里 我们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Here! We're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.51,0:56:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 呜 - 什么 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys… Ooh! Guys… Ooh! - What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.18,0:56:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有动静 呜 真的 呜 没错 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting something! Ooh! Here we go! Ooh! Oh yes! Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.64,0:56:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到隔离检疫站了 太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the quarantine! This is amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.57,0:56:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 我什么都看到了 还能看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! I can see everything! And I can see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.99,0:56:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.82,0:56:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我人生是彩色的 那你看得到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's a rainbow! Can you see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.32,0:56:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你们没像我这样厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, it doesn't work that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.37,0:56:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利鲸 - 好吧 叫多莉左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bailey! - Okay! Tell Dory to go left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.87,0:56:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says go left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.62,0:56:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.29,0:57:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呜 直走 - 直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! Straight! - Straight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.21,0:57:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直走 - 呜 右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Straight! - Ooh! Go right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.04,0:57:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右转 - 右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right! - Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.17,0:57:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 我头晕了 呜 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! I'm light-headed! Ooh! Wait. Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.97,0:57:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接收到别的动静 等等 我拉远一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm picking up something else. Hold on! Let me zoom out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.47,0:57:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈祖保佑啊 她不是一个人 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Neptune, she's not alone! Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.72,0:57:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.68,0:57:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不出来 不过他去追她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell! But it's coming for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.85,0:57:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 多莉 往另一边游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! Dory, swim! Swim the other way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.65,0:57:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 哪边 - 什么 哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Where? - What? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.19,0:57:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往右 - 右\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go right! - Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.69,0:57:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的右边 糟糕 她游向他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my right! Oh no! She's heading right towards it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.36,0:57:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 多莉 快回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Dory, turn around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.03,0:57:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 多莉 你又往我们游过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great, Dory! You're headed right toward us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.70,0:57:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你要我往右\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You want me to go right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.41,0:57:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是右转 我不敢看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Not right. Oh, I can't look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.04,0:57:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 马林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Marlin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.71,0:57:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 你没事 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it! You're okay! - Oh my gosh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.38,0:57:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吃掉她了 生吞活剥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's consuming her! It's eating her alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.84,0:57:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.59,0:57:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到我了 怎么找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found me! How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个疯蛤蜊 一直碎碎念\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a crazy clam. He wouldn't stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.89,0:58:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就慢慢后退 游进水管里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just slowly backed away from him and into these pipes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着就开始找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we just started looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.89,0:58:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我得先回答她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. I got to take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 对不起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay! Sorry for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.74,0:58:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.91,0:58:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 我找到马林和尼莫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - I found Marlin and Nemo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.53,0:58:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 听到了吗 多莉真的会讲鲸鱼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Did you hear that? Dory really does speak whale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.45,0:58:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了 不太好的记忆又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard. It's bringing back some very bad memories so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.37,0:58:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看游这边吧 跟我来 该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go this way. Follow me. It's time to head home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.75,0:58:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我爸妈在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Um… My parents are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.30,0:58:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 你找到爸妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are? - You found your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.26,0:58:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上也不是 是还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly. No. I mean not yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.89,0:58:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, I know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.76,0:58:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么去 我只知道要找帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know exactly how to get there, but I know that… I'm getting help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.23,0:58:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到隔离检疫站 - 隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down to quarantine. - Quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.10,0:58:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我还遇见一只七爪章鱼 超怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Oh, and I met this septopus, super cranky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.94,0:58:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他其实很好心 还带我进入展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but secretly kind of sweet, and he got me into the exhibit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.07,0:58:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,展览馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exhibit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.45,0:58:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.28,0:58:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得我爸妈会想见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think my parents will want to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.62,0:59:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么不想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why wouldn't they want to see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.79,0:59:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我跟他们失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… I lost them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.96,0:59:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 你爸妈见到你一定高兴死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, your parents are going to be overjoyed to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.76,0:59:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定非常想念 你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to have missed… everything about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.80,0:59:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.51,0:59:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我们怎么找到你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how we found you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.47,0:59:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那只蛤蜊吗 还是 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something about a clam? Or… - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.12,0:59:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牡蛎 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, an oyster. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.13,0:59:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 软体动物 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mollusk? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.34,0:59:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么东西？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.52,0:59:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不 不是 - 不是蛤蜊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't… no? - No clam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.93,0:59:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找得很辛苦 直到尼莫想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were having a very hard time until Nemo thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.81,0:59:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What would Dory do?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.31,0:59:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.82,0:59:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我认识你 你一直让我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because ever since I've met you, you've shown me how to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.99,0:59:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何去做想都不敢想的事 疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff I never dreamed of doing. Crazy things!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.03,0:59:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟鲨鱼斗智 跳水母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outsmarting sharks and jumping jellyfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.70,0:59:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有找到我儿子 全都多亏了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finding my son. You made all that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.33,0:59:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 我不知道你那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I didn't know you thought that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.17,0:59:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没忘记 是我没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't forget. I never told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.85,1:00:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.81,1:00:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 因为你的积极\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dory, because of who you are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.19,1:00:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要找到你爸妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are about to find your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.65,1:00:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那个时候 你就回到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you do that, you'll be home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.71,1:00:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.38,1:00:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示我们要跟多莉说再见啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean we have to say goodbye to Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.34,1:00:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 尼莫 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Nemo. We do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.45,1:00:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩多少要装上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so how much more we got left to load?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.57,1:01:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下这最后一排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just this last row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.24,1:01:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越早搬完\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner we finish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.07,1:01:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车就能越快抵达克里夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sooner this truck gets to Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.08,1:01:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心转弯 小心什么 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the turn. Watch what? Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.54,1:01:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了 好 我想快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late. Okay, I think we're close. Whee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.42,1:01:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.79,1:01:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.92,1:01:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里 我们在隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! This is it! We're in quarantine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents are here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.55,1:01:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里 不 为什么往大门过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going? Hey, what… No, why are we going towards the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.55,1:01:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都康复了 - 我感觉棒呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are all better! - Yay! I feel fantastic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.77,1:01:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人 快走 借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family! Come on, let's go! Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.44,1:01:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.28,1:01:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 妈咪 我来了 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming Mommy! I'm coming Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.11,1:01:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呼 快到家了 我快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Almost home. Almost home. I'm almost home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.83,1:01:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm getting the hang of this! Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.42,1:01:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear footsteps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.96,1:01:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七条郎 - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hank! - Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.26,1:02:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 我要去水箱 押韵吔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, we need to get in that tank. That rhymed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.80,1:02:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 她爸妈在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Her parents are there! Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.18,1:02:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三分钟 带大家进来这个杯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you've got three minutes to get everyone in this cup with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.31,1:02:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就上卡车去克里夫兰 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm on that truck to Cleveland, got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.31,1:02:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.94,1:02:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.15,1:02:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.28,1:02:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸 大家好 是我 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad? Hey, everybody. It's me, Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.66,1:02:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 珍妮和查理的多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory? Dory? Dory? Jenny and Charlie's Dory? Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.62,1:02:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.00,1:02:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.84,1:02:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.84,1:02:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她应该随便选两个就好了 - 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She should just pick 2 and let's go. - Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.51,1:02:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 开玩笑的 人家要团圆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm kidding. It's a reunion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.05,1:02:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸 我的爸妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad? Where are my parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.85,1:02:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 你真的是珍妮和查理的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory? Are you really Jenny and Charlie's girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.06,1:02:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是我 他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am! That's me! Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.31,1:02:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 就在你失踪以后 他们以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, Dory, right after you disappeared, they thought you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.53,1:03:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为你一定被抓到 这隔离检疫站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they thought you must have ended up here, in quarantine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.90,1:03:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 所以呢 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh? - Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.87,1:03:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们来这里找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so they came here to look for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来这里 他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here! Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.66,1:03:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 那是好几年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, that was years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.38,1:03:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 他们始终没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - They never came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.38,1:03:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.59,1:03:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 鱼如果没从隔离检疫站回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Dory, when fish don't come back from quarantine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.01,1:03:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就表示他们没\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means they're not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.01,1:03:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.60,1:03:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, they're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.52,1:03:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.02,1:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们想找你 - 等等 你确定他们走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They wanted to find you… - Wait. Are you sure they're gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.40,1:03:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 听着 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, listen, it's going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.69,1:03:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 他们好爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, they loved you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.24,1:03:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想到克里夫兰去的人 最后警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone not looking to go to Cleveland, final warning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.78,1:03:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 你没事吧 - 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory, are you all right? - Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.75,1:03:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来太晚了 - 多莉 不 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was too late. - Dory, no. No. Now listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.08,1:03:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有家人了 - 不 多莉 别乱说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have a family. - No, Dory. That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.59,1:04:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.96,1:04:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孤孤单单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.97,1:04:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory. Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.72,1:04:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's everybody else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.10,1:04:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的橘色朋友就要去克里夫兰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your orange friends are on their way to Cleveland. Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.77,1:04:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到那只章鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the octopus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.73,1:04:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.78,1:04:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy? Daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.45,1:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.00,1:04:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. Help. Help. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.96,1:04:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 拜托 谁来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Help me. Please. Somebody help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.64,1:04:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗 我跟他们失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can… Help me? Can you help me? I've lost them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.18,1:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟谁失散 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Lost who? - I-I-I-I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.68,1:04:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 亲爱的 你不记得我也帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, sorry, honey. I can't help you if you don't remember. Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.94,1:05:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗 我失散了 跟他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Can you help me? I've lost… them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.19,1:05:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能讲清楚一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can you be more specific?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.69,1:05:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My… My… Them! Them! Them! Um… Um… Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.33,1:05:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please? They're gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.31,1:05:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟大家失散了 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost… I've lost everyone. There's nothing I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.23,1:05:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 我不能忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot, I can't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.69,1:05:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了什么 一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I forgetting? Something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的事 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something important. What was it? I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.32,1:05:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么 我要忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it? It's going away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.29,1:06:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要忘记了 因为我记性太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going away. It's going because all I can do is forget. I just forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.54,1:06:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记是我最拿手的 我就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I forget. That's what I do best. That's what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.00,1:06:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do? What do I do? What do I do? What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.55,1:06:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.89,1:06:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看看四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.23,1:06:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边只有水 这边有很多海带\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, there's just water over there. And a lot of kelp over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.94,1:06:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海带比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelp is better. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.62,1:06:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢 好多海带 看来都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Now what? Lots of kelp. It looks the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.37,1:06:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都一样 除了那边有块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all looks the same, except there's a rock… over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.42,1:06:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有沙子 我喜欢沙子 湿湿软软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some sand this way. I like sand. Sand is squishy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.11,1:07:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this isn't going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.73,1:07:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都没有 只有一大堆海带\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here. Nothing but kelp. Lots of kelp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.99,1:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有一些贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some shells… this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.12,1:07:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like… shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.15,1:07:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.90,1:08:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.03,1:08:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 多莉 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Dory! You're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.07,1:08:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的宝贝 - 你真的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh my baby! - You're really here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.99,1:08:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看你 - 你找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me look at you. - You found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.20,1:08:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让你走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never letting you go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.37,1:08:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走失的女儿回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my missing girl, you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.54,1:08:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的宝贝 - 是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My baby! - It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.71,1:08:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然是 - 真是你们 妈 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Oh absolutely! - It's really you! Mom, you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.42,1:08:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 爸 你也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am, I… - And Dad, so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.34,1:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.38,1:08:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.22,1:09:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 宝贝 不 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh honey. Oh honey, no. Kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.05,1:09:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我有问题 我好抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I've got a problem. I know I'm… And I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.89,1:09:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段时间我一直想改善\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all this time I've wanted to fix it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.35,1:09:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不行 我很努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't and I try. I try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.06,1:09:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的想法 会离开我脑袋 念头会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my thoughts… they leave my head and ideas change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.07,1:09:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我忘了你们 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd forgotten you and I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.86,1:09:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 别说对不起 你看你有多棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory. Don't you dare be sorry. Look what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.07,1:09:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You found us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.41,1:09:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.58,1:09:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这些年我们为何 一直待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, why do you think we stayed put here all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.29,1:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们相信 总有一天你会再找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we believed one day you'd find us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.34,1:09:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.13,1:09:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们走了 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought you were gone. How did you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.13,1:09:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去隔离检疫站找你 但你不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went into quarantine to look for you, but you weren't there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.39,1:09:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你一定是穿过水管出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we knew you must have gotten out through the pipes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.56,1:09:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过水管 没错 所以我们也跟着出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the pipes. That's right, sweetie. And so we did too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.94,1:09:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我们就一直待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've stayed in this spot for you ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.61,1:09:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为你会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought you might come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.94,1:09:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以留下来等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stayed and waited for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.44,1:09:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每天都出来摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So every day, we go out and lay out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.40,1:10:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.95,1:10:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你找到我们了 宝贝 你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you found us. Oh honey, you found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.96,1:10:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你为何找得到吗 因为你记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know why you found us? Because you remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.00,1:10:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用自己神奇的方法想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remembered in your own, amazing, Dory way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.43,1:10:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我全靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. All by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.47,1:10:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 真的吗 这些年你都自己过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey. Really? Have you been by yourself all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.14,1:10:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可怜的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my poor little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.98,1:10:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是都靠自己啦 马林和尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I haven't been all by myself… Marlin and Nemo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.78,1:10:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看到多莉去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody saw where Dory went?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.99,1:10:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sorry. I didn't see anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.11,1:10:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 这么多睁眼瞎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously? That's a lot of eyeballs doing nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.28,1:10:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, excuse me. Can you help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.03,1:10:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在找 - 我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're looking… - Me help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.33,1:10:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你看 是多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, look! It's Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.17,1:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank goodness. See, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.37,1:10:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼莫 我就知道她有办法 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, I knew she'd find a way… What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.84,1:10:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉呢 她跟你在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where's Dory? Is she with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.17,1:11:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我想抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I tried to hold on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.34,1:11:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没抓住 跟她走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't and I lost her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.55,1:11:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 好了 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - All right. Let's get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.68,1:11:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.05,1:11:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我会说鲸鱼话 他还是把我们吞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the whale swallowed us even though I speak whale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.52,1:11:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,马林根本不相信我会说鲸鱼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually Marlin never believes I even know how to speak whale…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.98,1:11:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 他多少还算信得过我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know what, he always kind of trusts me anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经喜欢这个马林了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I like this Marlin already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.69,1:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 后来我们找到尼莫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And then somehow we found Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.15,1:11:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是他找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did he find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.32,1:11:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 可是尼莫真的好贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But, you know what, Nemo is the sweetest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.90,1:11:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不管怎么样都不会丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just never gives up on me no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.03,1:11:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.03,1:11:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见到马林和尼莫 一定要谢谢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll certainly have to thank Marlin and Nemo when we meet them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.37,1:11:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我认得这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait I know this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.75,1:11:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是海博馆馆长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm Sigourney Weaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.75,1:11:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里 - 请跟我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There! - Won't you please join us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是海洋生物博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Marine Life Institute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.71,1:11:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在那里出生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were born there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.52,1:11:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 你朋友在那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ODory, is that where your friends are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他们困在一个东西里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! They were stuck in something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.22,1:11:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要去某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was going somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.22,1:11:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车 他们在卡车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A truck. They're in the truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.89,1:11:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我可能 永远见不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means I could… Never see them again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.23,1:11:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no. What would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.23,1:11:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们是你的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I know they're good friends of yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.56,1:11:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但卡车的难度太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a truck is kind of a tall order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.44,1:12:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我只知道我想他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Please. All I know is that I miss them. I… I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.90,1:12:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想他们 我以前说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really miss them. I've said that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.37,1:12:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.74,1:12:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 马林和尼莫不只是好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Marlin and Nemo are more than good friends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.41,1:12:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也算我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.42,1:12:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得救他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to get them back. See, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.13,1:12:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初他们好像注定要找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they found me it felt like fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.42,1:12:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I mean? Or… I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.75,1:12:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,命中注定的另一个说法是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's another word for fate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.26,1:12:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像命运 命运 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like destiny. Destiny? Destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.59,1:12:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory? - Destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.72,1:12:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 命 - 是多莉 出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Dest… - Sh. It's Dory. Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.77,1:12:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 找到了 她就在海博馆外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I got her. She's right outside the institute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.86,1:12:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命运 - 我们得跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Destiny? - We got to jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.23,1:12:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳下去 - 没时间解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jump? - No time to argue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.86,1:12:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.57,1:12:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 载你朋友的卡车出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! The truck thing with your friends is leaving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.61,1:12:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 命运 糟了 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Destiny. Oh no! That's bad! What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.12,1:12:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.46,1:12:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 一 二 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go. One. Two. - Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.08,1:13:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法 我在外头活不成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't! I can't do it! I'll never make it out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.17,1:13:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 我有史上最强眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny! I've got the world's most powerful pair of glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.76,1:13:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有史上最强眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the world's most powerful pair of glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.59,1:13:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你的眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.09,1:13:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的眼 可是有墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be my eyes. But the walls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.51,1:13:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋里没有墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no walls in the ocean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.18,1:13:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没墙 - 这是你的命运 命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No walls? - It's your destiny, Destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.48,1:13:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why didn't you say so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.77,1:13:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 命运 等等 不 那是墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No! Destiny, wait! No, that's a wall! Wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.49,1:13:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸 这是我的管友 命运 打招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad, this is my pipe pal. Destiny, say hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.36,1:13:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 这些蓝泡泡是你爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Are these little blue blobs your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.91,1:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得跟你一样耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look just like you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.37,1:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 我是利鲸 多莉妈 多莉爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm Bailey. Mrs Dory, Mr Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.16,1:13:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫我珍妮就好 - 我是查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh please, call me Jenny. - Oh and I'm Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.71,1:13:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快走吧 去拦下那辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. We got to go. We got to stop that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.96,1:13:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.84,1:13:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸 报告状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bailey, status report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.34,1:13:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我有神奇的天赋 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, my beautiful gift. Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.68,1:13:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 卡车要上高速公路往南开 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it! The truck's merging onto the freeway and it's heading south. Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.51,1:13:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 一定要拦住那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We are stopping that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.23,1:13:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这非看不可 - 对 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This I've got to see. - Yeah, yeah, me too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.69,1:14:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀 一定超精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy, this is gonna be good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.19,1:14:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杰 你是不是起肖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… Gerald! Have you lost your marbles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.82,1:14:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要得寸进尺 阿杰 - 厚脸皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't get used to it, Gerald! - Cheeky joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.53,1:14:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸 我什么都忘了 提醒一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bailey, I forgot everything. Catch me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.57,1:14:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 呜 你朋友还在卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am. Ooh. Your friends are still on the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.70,1:14:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 他们往北边的桥上开去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. They're headed north towards the bridge. Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 那边有一群可爱的海獭 我要一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, there's a bunch of cute otters over there. I want one! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.67,1:14:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow, Bailey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.17,1:14:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到卡车了 在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I see the truck. It's over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.42,1:14:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉会怎么做 - 我们上不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, what would Dory do? - I don't see how we can get on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.26,1:14:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能让交通停顿就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, if only there was a way to stop traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.43,1:14:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通停顿 所有人都得停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop traffic. Stop traffic! Everyone needs to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.93,1:14:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,人会停下来看东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}People stop to look at things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.85,1:14:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢 可爱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that they like. Things that are cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.85,1:14:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的东西 我想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that are cute! Okay, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.90,1:14:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 快点 免得我忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? What is it? - Quickly before I forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.73,1:14:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 卡车上桥之后 把我甩上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny, when the truck reaches the bridge you flip me up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.23,1:14:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跟我来 其他人待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, follow me. Everyone else, stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.24,1:14:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 宝贝 你不能再离开我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Dory. Honey, you're not leaving us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.95,1:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈说得对 你得留在我们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother's right. You have to stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.78,1:15:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 万一你离开太久怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, what happens if… You know, if you're gone for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.79,1:15:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你一时迷糊 分心失神 万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you get confused and that makes you distracted. And what if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.58,1:15:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又跟你们失散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lose you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.29,1:15:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.09,1:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 爸 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad, it's gonna be okay because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.97,1:15:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道就算我忘了 也能再找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that even if I forget I can find you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.22,1:15:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 左边一点 呜 稍微回来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Okay a little left. Ooh. Back the other way a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.98,1:15:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 好了 开始 还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Okay, that's it. Go! Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.27,1:15:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利鲸 - 好 开始 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bailey! - Okay, now! Now! Do it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.44,1:15:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该照你的想法做了 - 什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time for your idea. - Okay. What idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.99,1:15:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么做 多莉会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What do I do? What would Dory do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.54,1:15:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子 我看到车子 海獭在车子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, cars, cars. I see cars. Otters in front of cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.96,1:15:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,车得停下来 交通停顿 拥抱派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars have to stop. Stop traffic! Cuddle party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.46,1:15:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.63,1:15:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好可爱喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so cute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们 有一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them! There must be one, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.81,1:16:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 爸 - 说不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on, Dad? - I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.31,1:16:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么的 我认为这关联到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know in what way, but I think this has something to do with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.86,1:16:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 水 我需要水\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Water. Water. I need water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.86,1:16:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 你怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? How'd you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.20,1:16:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为再也见不到你了 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought we'd never see you again. - Aw, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.20,1:16:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 我再怎么努力都忘不了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, darn it, no matter how hard I tried I just couldn't forget you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.58,1:16:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我太想念其他的家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I missed the rest of my family too much, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.04,1:16:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是家人 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're family? - Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.88,1:16:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道那是什么感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that feels like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.67,1:16:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know what that feels like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.88,1:16:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.55,1:16:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下车 那不是你们的鱼 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, come on. Out of the truck. Those aren't your fish. Shoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 海獭走了 - 回水里去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh no. There goes our ride. - Back in the water. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.85,1:16:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 车子开始动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, the traffic is starting to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.35,1:16:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我 放心 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to me. I got this. Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.27,1:16:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 回来 我们需要你帮忙 贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky! Becky, come back. We need your help! Becky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.78,1:16:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.28,1:17:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 多莉没跟来 贝琪 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait. We don't have Dory! No, no, Becky wait! Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.79,1:17:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去 贝琪 回去 呜噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go back. Becky, back! Back, Becky! Loo-loo. Ooo-roo-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.25,1:17:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托别吃我们 - 多莉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please don't eat us! - Where's Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.04,1:17:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Jenny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.79,1:17:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马林 - 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marlin? - Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.70,1:17:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼莫 非常感谢 - 感谢你们照顾多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo? Thank you so much. - Thank you for taking care of Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.22,1:17:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 她还在卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! She's still in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.30,1:17:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 去接多莉 呜噜 多噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky! Fetch Dory! Ooo-roo. Dor-roo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.56,1:17:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 该说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kid. I guess this is goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.90,1:17:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - What do you mean, "No"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.10,1:17:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能去克里夫兰 你跟我回到海里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to the Cleveland. You are coming to the ocean with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.82,1:17:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么老是要破坏我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you and ruining my plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.53,1:17:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我只有一个目标 那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, I have one goal in life. One! And it is to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.11,1:17:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才听好 计划有什么了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you listen to me. What is so great about plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.20,1:17:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.49,1:17:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有计划跟爸妈失散吗 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I plan to lose my parents? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.08,1:17:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有计划找到马林吗 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I plan to find Marlin? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.24,1:17:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有计划要认识吗 等等 有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you and I plan to meet? Wait. Did we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.96,1:17:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你讲完了没 - 我们可没事先计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you almost done? - Well, I don't think we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.29,1:17:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最好的事情都是自然发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's because the best things happen by chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.92,1:17:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.29,1:17:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你跟我到大海里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you being with me out in the ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.34,1:17:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是待在玻璃箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}not safe in some glass box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.09,1:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个朋友叫海博馆馆长 她跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine… Her name's sigourney… Once told me that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.43,1:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要三个小步骤\N{\fnArial\fs30}all it takes is three simple steps:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.14,1:18:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救 治疗复健 然后还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue, rehabilitation, and one other thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.68,1:18:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.77,1:18:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right! So what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.10,1:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release! Release! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.27,1:18:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release! Release! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.53,1:18:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release! Release! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.20,1:18:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来要说 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna say, "Okay."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.24,1:18:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.79,1:18:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 他们开走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! They're going away! Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.87,1:18:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.96,1:18:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 大家抓着我的鳍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Guys, grab my fin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.63,1:18:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 他想把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! He's trying to get the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.38,1:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 门从外面锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. It's locked from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.46,1:18:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 多莉 你一定行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dory. You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.84,1:18:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运 命运 墙 墙 墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny! Destiny! Wall! Wall! Wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 不 等等 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, no! Wait! Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.64,1:18:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,利鲸 他们往哪走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bailey, where are they headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.56,1:18:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 我没讯号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I'm losing them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.65,1:18:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.81,1:18:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一定有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's got to be a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.69,1:18:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There's a way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.07,1:19:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉 听我说 没办法出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, now listen to me. There's no way to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.82,1:19:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有办法 总是有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… There's got to be a way. There's always a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.78,1:19:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 多莉 这次真的没有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't, Dory. I'm telling you. This time there is no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.58,1:19:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.79,1:19:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 真的有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy carp. There is another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.62,1:19:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,深吸一口气 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.25,1:19:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release! Release! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release! Release! Release! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.93,1:19:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 我不管 把它弄下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? I don't care what it is! Get it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.31,1:19:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.19,1:19:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,认输吧 两只脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck it, bipeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.56,1:19:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 你有七只手 快想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Hank, you've got seven arms… I don't know. Just try something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.86,1:19:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.15,1:19:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 等等 不 - 停车 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? Hey! Stop. Stop. Wait! No! - Hey! Hey! Stop. Wait. Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.66,1:19:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有想办法喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's doing something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.53,1:19:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在动了 厉害 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are moving. Good job, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.53,1:19:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 什么 停下来 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, wait! Come on! Whoa! - Hey! What? Hey! Stop! Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.62,1:19:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是嫌弃你的开车技巧 我又不会开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm not trying to tell you how to drive. Certainly I can't do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.08,1:19:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没资格 但你能开快点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in any position… But could you go faster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.38,1:20:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no! No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.30,1:20:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车还我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Give us our truck back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.68,1:20:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都看不见 要往哪边开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see squat. Which way are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.39,1:20:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的车都往左 那就往左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, all the cars are going left so go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.64,1:20:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉曼街 艾许比大道 鲍威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilman Street. Ashby Avenue. Powell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.39,1:20:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是吉曼街 又是吉曼街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilman Street again. Huh. Gilman Street again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.56,1:20:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几时才要左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer are we gonna veer left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.24,1:20:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要知道怎么上来 就知道怎么下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we just need to know how we got on, then we'll know how to get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.53,1:20:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你弄清楚了再告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me know when you figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.20,1:20:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我不记得是怎么上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately I can't remember how we got on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.99,1:20:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得他们 我们就从那里来 右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know those guys! That's where we came from. Turn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.88,1:20:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿嘿嘿 - 等等 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Hey, hey, hey! Wait! - Oh my… Whoa. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.63,1:20:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们铁定要被炒鱿鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.97,1:20:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前开 往前 左 不 右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep straight. Straight. Left. Left. No, no, no. Right. Right. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.39,1:20:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 技术真好 七条郎 - 注意看路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good driving, Hank. - Pay attention to the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.64,1:20:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 岔路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. Oh. Uh-oh. Fork in the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.02,1:20:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪边 - 海洋 有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way? - Ocean. Ocean. Hey, a boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.48,1:21:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次遇到船都没好事 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I haven't had great experiences with boats, but I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.52,1:21:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪边 - 船会往大海去 右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way? - Boats go to the ocean. Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.82,1:21:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.49,1:21:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 孩子 现在往哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of time, kid. Where do we go now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.28,1:21:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看 不知道 总会出现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Okay, I'll figure it out. I don't know, but… Well, something will come and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.83,1:21:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海鸥 七条郎 跟着那些鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seagulls. Hank, follow those birds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.62,1:21:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海在左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ocean's left, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.96,1:21:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, mine, mine, mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.00,1:21:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 呜 又有动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Hold on. Ooh. I'm getting something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.34,1:21:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们吗 一切没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it them? Is everything perfect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.88,1:21:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条子 完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh, it's the fuzz. Busted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.68,1:21:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 是海洋 就在前面 全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're good. The ocean! It's straight ahead. Floor it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.56,1:21:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.77,1:21:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔噢 - 你在喔噢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Uh-oh! - What do you mean, "Uh-oh"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.15,1:21:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了 该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. What would I do? What would I do? What would I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.78,1:21:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,七条郎 我要请你做一件疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, I'm gonna ask you to do something crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.32,1:21:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再疯也不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay with crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.37,1:21:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 七条郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.99,1:21:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 没有出路 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. There's no way out. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.83,1:21:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要进鱼监狱了 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to fish jail! Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.29,1:22:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 呜 不 呜 让开 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Ooh. Oh no. Ooh. Get back! Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.83,1:22:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish! Dory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.38,1:22:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所看到的代表海博馆三大任务中\N{\fnArial\fs30}What lies before you represents the third and final part of the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.63,1:22:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的一个部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marine Life mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.68,1:22:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救 治疗复健与释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue, rehabilitation, and release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.60,1:22:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来爸爸身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to Papa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.02,1:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海博馆馆长 谢谢你们加入我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sigourney Weaver. Thank you for joining me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.24,1:23:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four… Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.08,1:23:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我为什么在数数 大家跑去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Why am I counting? Hey, where is everyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.95,1:23:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们丢下我了 不 他们不会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh, did they leave me? No! No, no. They wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.54,1:23:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我会想清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's okay. I can figure this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.29,1:23:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚我在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I just doing then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.59,1:23:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在遮住我的脸 所以是想躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, um, covering my face, so I was trying to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.76,1:23:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么想躲起来 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so why was I trying to hide? Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.09,1:23:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 六 七 八 九 十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I… Five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.93,1:23:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了没 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready or not, here I come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.43,1:23:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, found you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.93,1:23:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haha! Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.31,1:23:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小朋友 下课时间结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you little shrimps, recess is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.44,1:23:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讨厌 - 没有人找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw, man. - Ah, nobody found me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.77,1:23:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来 该上另一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in. Time for another…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.90,1:23:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 该上另一堂课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me. Time for another lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.48,1:23:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷老师什么时候洄游回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When is Mr Ray coming back from his migration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.15,1:23:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他够聪明 就会尽量拖着不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's smart he'll stay away from here as long as he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.45,1:23:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来之前 我就是代课老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until he does, I'm your substitute teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.45,1:23:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友 谁想学传声定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay kids, who wants to learn about echolocation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.95,1:24:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.33,1:24:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 那其实很酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, guys. It's actually really cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.75,1:24:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肝 好好玩喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kelpcake. Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.46,1:24:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是游泳的好天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice day for a swim, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.29,1:24:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妈 再见 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bye Mom. Bye Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.29,1:24:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们回家去 在海葵身上找吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we'll go back home and brush up on the anemone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.01,1:24:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来吗 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming, Dory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.47,1:24:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我打算到悬崖那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Oh I'm just going to the dropoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.97,1:24:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 什么 悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. What? The dropoff? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.51,1:24:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's… That's a good idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.35,1:24:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想去那里看看风景 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I just thought I'd go enjoy the view. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.27,1:24:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,风景 那就玩得开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The view. Well, you have a good time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己一个 别迷路罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All by yourself. Not getting lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.33,1:24:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.71,1:24:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.34,1:24:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. No, no. No, no, Dory. Dory. Dory! D…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马林 - 嗨 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Marlin. - Oh, hey. Hello, Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.86,1:25:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 你怎么很担心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? You look worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.48,1:25:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很好 我天生苦瓜脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I'm fine. It's how I always look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.83,1:25:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.70,1:25:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.16,1:25:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.21,1:25:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 你成功了 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yay! - You did it, kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.88,1:25:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Did what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.38,1:25:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你一路跟着贝壳回到家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, you just followed the shells all the way back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.01,1:25:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真的吗 我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh! I did? All by myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.06,1:25:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 知道这代表什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Do you know what this means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.23,1:25:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有决心 什么都难不倒你 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you can do whatever you put your mind to, Dory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.86,1:25:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.19,1:25:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 我能跟他们玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, can I go play with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.90,1:26:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 - 没问题 去吧 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Absolutely! Go get them, kelpcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.91,1:26:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.05,1:26:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,风景真的很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is quite a view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.10,1:26:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.48,1:26:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人难忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unforgettable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.85,1:35:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去 下去 下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off, off, off, off, off, off, off, off, off, off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.48,1:35:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 滚 对 快点 很好 再滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Roll, roll. That's it. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.15,1:35:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定行 快到了 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Just roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.86,1:35:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly going to vomit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.70,1:35:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们看 - 伙伴们 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Voilà! - All right, gang, good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.83,1:35:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 亮亮 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Flo, we made it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.16,1:35:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从此再也不会碰到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't have any more problems from here on out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.62,1:35:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不尊重海洋生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No respect for ocean life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.67,1:35:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
